<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Matriks Semua Komponen RPM</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;margin:10px}
h1,h2,h3{margin:4px 0}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6px 0;table-layout:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #000;padding:5px;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word}
th{background:#d9ead3;font-weight:bold;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1}
.section-header{background:#f4c27f;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;text-align:left}
.subsection-header{background:#fce5cd;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px}
small{font-size:10px;color:#444}
.col-rpm{background:#e8f5e9;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;width:60px}
.col-jp{background:#fff8e1;text-align:center;width:60px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Matriks Semua Komponen RPM - DDPK Jurusan RPL</h1>
<p><strong>Mapel:</strong> Dasar-Dasar Pengembangan Perangkat Lunak dan Gim (DDPK) | <strong>Fase:</strong> E | <strong>Beban:</strong> 12 JP/minggu (2x pertemuan, ~6 JP/pertemuan) | <strong>Durasi:</strong> 2 semester / 36 minggu</p>

<h2>Panduan Pengisian</h2>
<ul>
<li>Baris = 1 RPM (RPM1, RPM2, dst.)</li>
<li>Kolom = 1 field data sesuai komponen RPM</li>
<li>Isi setiap sel sesuai data untuk RPM tersebut</li>
<li>Kolom bertanda <strong>*</strong> = wajib diisi</li>
<li>DPL dipilih dari 8 poin yang tersedia; tulis nomor dan nama DPL</li>
<li>Isi sel dengan tanda <strong>-</strong> jika tidak applicable</li>
</ul>

<h2>Matriks Data RPM</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="col-rpm">RPM</th>
<th class="col-jp">JP per Tatap Muka</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="7">A. IDENTITAS *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="8">B. DPL *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="4">C. MAPEL LINTAS</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="4">D. ELEMEN / CP / TP / ATP *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="3">E. PEMAHAMAN BERMAKNA *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="2">F. PERTANYAAN PEMANTIK *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="4">G. ALUR 3M *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="5">H. ASESMEN *</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="3">I. SUMBER BELAJAR</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="2">J. PENGAYAAN / REMEDIAL</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="3">K. REFLEKSI GURU</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="2">L. K3LH & 5R</th>
<th class="section-header" colspan="2">M. LAIN-LAIN</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th></th><th></th>
<!-- A. Identitas -->
<th class="subsection-header">Sekolah</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Program Keahlian</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Konsentrasi</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Mapel</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Fase</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Kelas/Sem</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Tahun Ajaran</th>
<!-- B. DPL -->
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 1</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 2</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 3</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 4</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 5</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 6</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 7</th>
<th class="subsection-header">DPL 8</th>
<!-- C. Mapel Lintas -->
<th class="subsection-header">Nama Mapel Lintas</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Hubungan</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Aktivitas</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Hasil</th>
<!-- D. Elemen/CP/TP/ATP -->
<th class="subsection-header">Elemen</th>
<th class="subsection-header">CP</th>
<th class="subsection-header">TP</th>
<th class="subsection-header">ATP</th>
<!-- E. Pemahaman Bermakna -->
<th class="subsection-header">Makna Inti</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Hubungan Dunia Kerja</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Alasan Penting</th>
<!-- F. Pertanyaan Pemantik -->
<th class="subsection-header">Pertanyaan 1-3</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Catatan</th>
<!-- G. Alur 3M -->
<th class="subsection-header">Memahami</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Mengaplikasi</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Merefleksi</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Durasi 3M</th>
<!-- H. Asesmen -->
<th class="subsection-header">Awal</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Proses</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Hasil</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Rubrik</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Tindak Lanjut</th>
<!-- I. Sumber -->
<th class="subsection-header">File RPM</th>
<th class="subsection-header">File ATP</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Lainnya</th>
<!-- J. Pengayaan -->
<th class="subsection-header">Pengayaan</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Remedial</th>
<!-- K. Refleksi -->
<th class="subsection-header">Keberhasilan</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Hambatan</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Tindak Lanjut</th>
<!-- L. K3LH -->
<th class="subsection-header">K3LH</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Budaya 5R</th>
<!-- M. Lain -->
<th class="subsection-header">Topik</th>
<th class="subsection-header">Catatan</th>
</tr>
</thead>
